cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AgriPAM-AI, please cite the archived software release below."
title: "AgriPAM-AI: auditable design support for agricultural microbial communities and genome editing"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "AgriPAM-AI team"
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/agripam-ai/agripam-ai"
url: "https://agripam-ai.streamlit.app"
abstract: >-
  AgriPAM-AI is an open, evidence-aware workflow connecting agricultural
  microbial-bank analysis, synthetic-community design, chassis selection,
  genome-editing assessment and screened construct design. Its outputs are
  computational decision-support results and do not establish editing activity.
keywords:
  - agricultural microbiology
  - synthetic microbial community
  - genome editing
  - CRISPR
  - bioinformatics

